    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jax: History Repeats Itself is a game similar to other animatronic-horror games, but with a twist.<br>Powered the latest Unreal Engine game technology, this is the first (slightly) realistic, and most elaborate game ever made by GameSharp.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lacking money, so you must find a job quick. You find an ad on a newspaper. You see that a warehouse is hiring guards, but first you're going to need to guard Jax's Burgers, a strange bootleg copy of another popular party place, for 5 nights. The place is known to... have its problems, and having almost directly plagiarized another company's code for their animatronics, whatever happens to them, happens to Jax's Burgers, and we all know how the other company turned out...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic lighting effects<br>- Easy to learn controls<br>- Fairly realistic screen effects<br>And more!<br><i>(Refer to the &quot;What is the current state of Early Access?&quot; section for more details.)</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jax: History Repeats Itself is a game similar to other animatronic-horror games, but with a twist.<br>Powered the latest Unreal Engine game technology, this is the first (slightly) realistic, and most elaborate game ever made by GameSharp.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lacking money, so you must find a job quick. You find an ad on a newspaper. You see that a warehouse is hiring guards, but first you're going to need to guard Jax's Burgers, a strange bootleg copy of another popular party place, for 5 nights. The place is known to... have its problems, and having almost directly plagiarized another company's code for their animatronics, whatever happens to them, happens to Jax's Burgers, and we all know how the other company turned out...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic lighting effects<br>- Easy to learn controls<br>- Fairly realistic screen effects<br>And more!<br><i>(Refer to the &quot;What is the current state of Early Access?&quot; section for more details.)</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Jax: History Repeats Itself is a horror game where you follow the story of Ernel, a young man hired as a security guard, to complete a series of shifts at Jax's Burgers to get a job at JHR Warehouses.",
